t she received from her parents."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her teammates believe she is a steady person who has a calm and composed nature."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Even if its just one star she will try her best to recover it, and with that goal set in mind she gives it her best."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Cannonette"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c21314"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/58/58c4939b079331f54edae75b39dd6067d74a272cedb1b269cce959fb0f98960b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3d/3df2a79c8db2050282f5e657a999afa562e243a5c3f5b94e9fcc50a07805d207.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c21315","characterName":"カミヤ・ユン","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c21315"},"originalCharacterName":"カミヤ・ユン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"20"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"620"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Now, Fuu-chan. Let’s intertwine just like the strings of destiny?\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Fu fu, it’s okay I’ll lead, my princess.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Position: Soldier"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Weapon: Bow gun"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He has a bright character and is kind to anyone, he takes great interest in the protagonist and flirts with her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Because he is always flirty and trying to make a move on the protagonist he is sometimes referred to as “pervert” by the team."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"When a Dealer is the target in a mission he becomes unsettled and loses his attitude."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Cannonette"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c21315"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3f/3f650b806314f8bb7a6ee90cc248b3b791f28a31769f502b4cfdc518243743cc.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/89/89ff9f5a774e37d5116102f0500d6bfcbfb0dd316026c36bcb13e7c2e4abed7a.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"逢坂 良太","creatorId":"vndb:s248","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s248","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s248","name":"逢坂 良太","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:57906","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c21316","characterName":"コノミ・レイラ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c21316"},"originalCharacterName":"コノミ・レイラ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"24"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1031"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Isn’t this a self-introduction?\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"As long as we tell each other what we want isn’t it fine?\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Position: Solider"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Weapon: Poison needle"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He likes to watch the stars and the planets."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Unlike Yun who is the friendly type, he is the complete opposite."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"His attitude towards others is cold and he uses offensive language, because of this the teammates refer to him as “ice man”."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He set an oath to himself stating \"I will never kill the Target\", which is the reason why he uses the only weapon in the team which does not kill the target."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Cannonette"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c21316"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/21/21c6687cef768ee57a0d8dfbe2445ec2ba4e211295c60c5693dbaea671ec1bad.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4a/4acbdd7d63cb9fbf3b812ba4c1c9d5711e4b20e472283d403960183a316da6b6.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"櫻井 孝宏","creatorId":"vndb:s50","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s50","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s50","name":"櫻井 孝宏","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:57901","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c21317","characterName":"ハルノ・ミクト","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c21317"},"originalCharacterName":"ハルノ・ミクト","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"18"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"708"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Ah… Th, thank you for being kind to me.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"I, well, I’m okay… Ufu ufufu.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Position: Soldier"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Weapon: String"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The youngest of the team, when in battle he controls strings with sharp knives at the end to fight."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Usually his attitude is like a small animal's: he's timid and gets scared easily, but when he feels embarrassed or upset he gets worked up and excitable."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Even he doesn't know what his true personality is."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Cannonette"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c21317"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4f/4f96a3110aeca2875042e7534443bcc0a96f1db049266716bd8cfb68b5782f09.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/37/377320c934c0ab66835535da7466d083cd7d197c5048543bded84faf9651d836.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小野 賢章","creatorId":"vndb:s250","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s250","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s250","name":"小野 賢章","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:57907","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c21318","characterName":"カノウ・チカイ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c21318"},"originalCharacterName":"カノウ・チカイ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"28"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"214"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Hm Hm? Are you embarrassed? Kyahahahaha♪ How cute★\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Just like this truth your ears, and cheeks are all red.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Position: Analysis"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Weapon: n/a"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The oldest of the team."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is honest and kind, he may be 28 but he acts younger than Mict who is the youngest."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is knowledgeable about Star, its components, types and an abundance of other things, every night he is investigating on his computer about it and there are still lots of puzzling parts about them."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He likes everything sweet, if presented with a salty food on the table he will eat it with sweet sauce on top of it."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Cannonette"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c21318"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5d/5de144f038b3c2db8c8986a56247533bb1a6ccfdb26521466ad87f57f8dae6f0.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2d/2d7d1875f4f8c8c24723a5401b56829e7909aa053aaabb7df8033c701e3e2da3.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"鈴村 健一","creatorId":"vndb:s90","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s90","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s90","name":"鈴村 健一","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:57902","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c41639","characterName":"ナナセ・イヅキ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c41639"},"originalCharacterName":"ナナセ・イヅキ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"35"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"119"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Position: Soldier"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Weapon: Whip"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The person who brought the protagonists team together. A 'Great Tenshi'."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He has a calm temperament and is basically a gentle person, but even though he is older he has really extreme reactions to love situations."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Being the only person in the team with prior experience, rather then just sending the team off he's the type that participates in the missions."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c41639"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b0/b04ddb31a9d796716c649c3cce537e1e6fe843e42c1ee90eb30b3fe04841b